# The drawing (an extension): the extrusion of path_extrude, File >
# Drawing Sheet shows the sheet's screen; the sheet goes to A2, the
# scale to 1:2, first angle, a title, a section of the top view and a
# detail of the front view, and File > Export Drawing writes it.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
menu File|Drawing Sheet...
tw
twmove 307 105
twdown L 307 105
twup L 307 105
twmove 325 145
twdown L 325 145
twup L 325 145
edit 1:2
twmove 172 165
twdown L 172 165
twup L 172 165
twmove 181 305
twdown L 181 305
twup L 181 305
edit PLATE
twmove 46 235
twdown L 46 235
twup L 46 235
edit top 0
twmove 46 275
twdown L 46 275
twup L 46 275
edit front -10 0 5 2
tw
file $tmp/sheet.svg
menu File|Export Drawing...
save
